  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ThreeFoldOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to ThreeFold -- a peer-to-peer Internet infrastructure platform providing decentralised compute, storage, and networking via the TF Grid. Stores OASIS holons and avatar data on ThreeFold's sovereign, carbon-neutral, self-healing global cloud. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Implement bounded ThreeFold CQL reads and capability-driven developer demo (3a94dff)\n- refactor: consolidate encrypted S3 provider family and conformance (ba17814)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Network/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ThreeFoldOASIS",
